Qwen3.5 R79 Legal Reasoning

This distribution contains original orchestration and retrieval code plus an
abstract reasoning-graph dataset. The model weights are distributed separately
from https://huggingface.co/xujianing1990/qwen3.5-9b-fp8-1949-1978-r79-public and are
derived from Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B under Apache-2.0.

No internal private reasoning traces, case-source paragraphs, local paths,
training corpora, or unreviewed Wiki originals are included in this repository.

